```
Reason:
The added condition explicitly checks if the TLV type falls within the range of supported debug TLVs before proceeding with memory allocation. This ensures that only recognized TLVs are processed, preventing incorrect memory allocation and subsequent errors during the application of the configuration. The second statement remains unchanged but is now safe due to the preceding check, ensuring that only valid TLVs contribute to the size calculation.


